# Wengz — core context

## Documentation canon (read before large changes)

| Doc | Purpose |
|-----|---------|
| `docs/ADVANCED_BUSINESS.md` | Actors, credits, packages, client journey, request lifecycle, payments, wallet, gaps |
| `docs/ADVANCED_TECHNICAL.md` | Stack versions, repo map, proxy, tRPC, i18n, cron, cache, uploads, env |
| `docs/DEPLOY.md` | VPS / GitHub Actions deploy |
| `docs/WENGZ_KNOWLEDGE.md` / `WENGZ_INTENT_PLAYBOOKS.md` | Landing assistant copy only |

| Code (UX / messaging) | Purpose |
|----------------------|---------|
| `src/lib/error-handler.ts` | Sonner toasts; `errors.*` in `messages/en.json` & `ar.json` |
